  <item><title>usefulwaves 0.0.9</title><description>Attach multiple screenshots to one dictation. The overlay shows smaller previews, and screenshots paste in capture order. You can copy images individually when a destination accepts one at a time. Turn on Save screenshot dictations as captures in Settings → Dictation to keep the transcript and screenshots together in one local note. Text-only dictation still pastes.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 09:45:59 +0100</pubDate><sparkle:version>9</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.0.9</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><enclosure url="https://github.com/uid4oe/usefulwaves-releases/releases/download/v0.0.9/usefulwaves-0.0.9.dmg" length="5795087" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="IiyYcP3sy1unW8RpAzu/CGb8QCXMSMvoSlN8ySsdqW1Va13VEOTCzK/L8SKMhpXBVbtXsgzciJyJQ9f0vpKRAg=="></enclosure></item></channel>
